            0.133,
            0.707,
            0.694,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Fix two nails to a piece of cardboard as shown in Fig. 4.1a. Fix the middle portion of the longer wire stretched between the nails, such that it is slightly above the surface of the cardboard. Attach one end of that wire to the cell holder and another end to the switch."
            }
          ]
        },
